*.pdf
# Raw SITEST or production captures; only masked fixtures may be committed.
recordings/
captures/
# The one exception: masked recordings written by the recorder (design s2-recorder-masker
# §7.3, §9.1). Raw captures stay ignored everywhere else.
!/tests/fixtures/masked/recordings/
# The recorder's vault (with SQLite's -journal, -wal and -shm side files), its age-encrypted
# backups and Keeper exports: never committed.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.age
[Kk]eeper*.json
[Kk]eeper*.csv
# TAP files.
*.tap
*.TAP

